ADDSPEC     diff : IF NIN(Z,Y) D(ellipticf(X,Y),Z) = D(X,Z)*mi((1+(-(Y*sin(X)^2)))^.5)
ADDSPEC     diff : IF NIN(Z,Y) D(elliptice(X,Y),Z) = D(X,Z)*(1+(-(Y*sin(X)^2)))^.5
ADDSPEC     diff : IF NIN(Z,A,Y) D(ellipticpi(A,X,Y),Z) = D(X,Z)*mi((1+(-(A*sin(X)^2)))*(1+(-(Y*sin(X)^2)))^.5)
ADDSPEC     diff : IF NIN(Z,A,B,C) D(hyp2f1(A,B,C,X),Z) = D(X,Z)*A*B*mi(C)*hyp2f1(A+1,B+1,C+1,X)
ADDSPEC     diff : IF NIN(Z,Y) D(besselj(Y,X),Z) = D(X,Z)*(besselj(Y+(-1),X)+(-(besselj(Y+1,X))))*.5

